WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:05.960
Now that bin deliveries for our expanded kerbside
collection service are well underway,

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.919
you’ll need to know how to use them.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.120
All the information you’ll need can be found
inside this pack,

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.420
including new collection calendars.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.940
Look out for it in your mailbox soon.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:22.080
For more information visit waimakariri.govt.nz/rethinkrubbish

